    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "White Settlement’s oldest street, White Settlement Road, was the sole public road during the town’s earliest days.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/White_Settlement%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In the 1880s, the railroad bypassed White Settlement, keeping the town off the main rail line.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
